      "justification": "46 dBm is the macro downlink power in the 3GPP 6G coverage assumptions (TR 38.914 Table 5.1.20.1-2), the E-UTRA reference base station (TR 36.942 Table 4.6), ITU-R M.2292 macro urban (Tables 3-4) and TR 38.921 (two polarisations, 7 GHz range). The same total power in every band; the power per MHz therefore falls with bandwidth (33 dBm/MHz at 20 MHz, 26 at 100 MHz, 20 at 400 MHz)."
